00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:00.970
Get some quick results,

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:04.170
find out that it's RSV and
just go about their merry way.

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:06.210
Instead they order a
complicated test that takes--

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:07.520
All right, it's a show, I get it.

